This repository does not vendor third-party source. Dependencies are installed by
`npm ci` from package-lock.json and remain under their own licenses. Inventory of
the lockfile at the time of writing (199 packages, every one declaring a license):
  runtime: MIT 46, Apache-2.0 27, BSD-3-Clause 5, ISC 5, 0BSD 1
  dev only (build/test tooling): additionally MIT, Apache-2.0 and 12 MPL-2.0 packages
Regenerate it from package-lock.json before each release; DEPENDENCIES.lock.json
records the direct dependencies with versions and integrity hashes.

Third-party software the lab modifies or runs:
- emulate (vercel-labs/emulate), Apache-2.0. scripts/patch-emulate.mjs edits one
  file of the installed package (dist/dist-B5YXZCS3.js) at install time to add a
  `slack.event_subscriptions` seed key. The patch is applied locally and is not
  redistributed; see docs/LEARNINGS.md L-001 and ADR-10.
- Floci (floci-io/floci), MIT, pulled as a container image by digest; not bundled.
- Agent Executor (google/ax) and Agent Substrate (agent-substrate/substrate),
  Apache-2.0, used only by the optional AX lane; images are built from their
  source by the operator and are not part of this repository.
- docs/diagrams/*.html were generated by archify 3.2.0 and contain its generated
  viewer code.

